OL,3,GNEWSADrought causing burst pipes, warns
OL,4,ASevern Trent
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurst pipes and leaks in Warwickshire
OL,7,Fare due to the drought, Severn Trent
OL,8,Fhas said.
OL,10,FThe recent hot weather has left the
OL,11,Fground dry and unstable, causing
OL,12,Fgreater movement in the soil and an
OL,13,Fincrease in pipes bursting, Doug
OL,14,FClarke, the firm's water resources
OL,15,Fstrategy lead, said.
OL,17,FWarwickshire, in particular, has "a lot
OL,18,Fof clay-type soils so you get a really
OL,19,Fhigh increase in the number of bursts,"
OL,20,Fhe added.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
