OL,3,GNEWSADrought causing burst pipes, warns
OL,4,ASevern Trent
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This summer when it has been really
OL,7,Fdry, we have seen double the rate of
OL,8,Fbursts happening compared to when it is
OL,9,Fa damper more settled period because of
OL,10,Fthat ground movement." Despite the
OL,11,Frecent intense rainfall the region is
OL,12,Fstill in drought.
